including both hardware-level and software-based adjustments. Chapter 5 analyzes the results of 
the optimization experiments, detailing benchmarking data and comparing different strategies. 
Through this structured approach, this thesis provides valuable insights into PC component 
optimization, offering both theoretical understanding and practical guidance for users looking to 
enhance their system's performance.
